l from $-1$ to $1$ (including $-1$ but not including $1$).\n\n- The codomain of $r$ is ${-1,1},$ the set containing the two numbers $-1$ and $1$ only.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $r:[-1,1)\\to {-1,1}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186360704 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172031 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bbac348b-629f-52a1-9bb3-0d3f8483ff44" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Arrow Function Notation" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050312 :topic/id #uuid "3efe4c7e-e297-5f41-9d4f-bfd04820c753" :topic/math-academy-id 3334 :topic/title "Sets and Functions"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ae73709-fe5b-5f16-9b74-31dec32ca855" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469824} {:answer/id #uuid "1eb7d921-a5c2-5849-8662-36a792a6e641" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469825}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1eb7d921-a5c2-5849-8662-36a792a6e641" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469825} :answer-field/id #uuid "beef1889-063a-50cc-b883-c9539c59ae0f" :answer-field/key "$p:(-2,2]\\to (-2,2]$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470524} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e3b76c4-13e1-56b2-91e8-5ebcaa86f30a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469826} {:answer/id #uuid "1c1e6d97-ec46-5e8b-a3c8-af719a4324a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469827}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e3b76c4-13e1-56b2-91e8-5ebcaa86f30a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :